v4.1 review fixes: admit recomputes C from evidence; scenario binding; counts; CI\n\nF1: admit(result, evidence, contract, claim_type) recomputes C from the evidence and\nrefuses any presented C that differs from it, so an edited authorized flag is refused.\nF2: an edited or removed binding.scenario is refused by the same equality; with the\ndigest recomputed from the consumer's contract this fixes scenario and claim_type to it.\nA third case found while fixing: a replay-only result with its whole binding rewritten\nto revision 3 was admitted by the first admit; now refused.\nWitnesses reused_tampered_authorized / reused_tampered_scenario / reused_forged_binding,\neach with a physical mutation control on the recompute check (9/9 KILLED, normal and -O).\nREADME: 57 rows (was misreported as 58), consumption = observation not validation.\nCI: coverage-v4_1.yml runs comparison, tests and mutations in both modes.\nNo v4 file changed; manifest updates v4.1 entries and adds the workflow only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-10-19T01:37:30Z","author":{"name":"babyblueviper1","email":"contact@agents.babyblueviper.com"},"committer":{"name":"babyblueviper1","email":"contact@agents.babyblueviper.com"}},"repository":{"id":1422280233,"node_id":"R_kgDOVMZGKQ","name":"verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition","full_name":"pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition","private":false,"owner":{"login":"pipavlo82","id":212635108,"node_id":"U_kgDODKyN5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212635108?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82","html_url":"https://github.com/pipavlo82","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://a