iable-ai-guarantee-composition/actions/runs/39186213813/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/actions/runs/39186213813/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/actions/runs/39186213813/rerun","previous_attempt_url":null,"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/actions/workflows/386862353","head_commit":{"id":"c14d96b0a63fceba02b2cb4469d5b3228ae46612","tree_id":"9499928670e579c45965f67d95e53abd7217e98e","message":"v4.1 review fixes: admit recomputes C from evidence; scenario binding; counts; CI\n\nF1: admit(result, evidence, contract, claim_type) recomputes C from the evidence and\nrefuses any presented C that differs from it, so an edited authorized flag is refused.\nF2: an edited or removed binding.scenario is refused by the same equality; with the\ndigest recomputed from the consumer's contract this fixes scenario and claim_type to it.\nA third case found while fixing: a replay-only result with its whole binding rewritten\nto revision 3 was admitted by the first admit; now refused.\nWitnesses reused_tampered_authorized / reused_tampered_scenario / reused_forged_binding,\neach with a physical mutation control on the recompute check (9/9 KILLED, normal and -O).\nREADME: 57 rows (was misreported as 58), consumption = observation not validation.\nCI: coverage-v4_1.yml runs comparison, tests and mutations in both modes.\nNo v4 file changed; manifest updates v4.1 entries and adds the workflow only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-10-19T01:37:30Z","author":{"name":"babyblueviper1","email":"contact@agents.babyblueviper.com"},"committer":{"name":"babyblueviper1","email":"contact@agents.babyblueviper.com"}},"repository":{"id":1422280233,"node_id":"R_kgDOVMZGKQ","name":"verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition","full_name":"pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition",